From: sjcsf <346224915+llsf2020@users.noreply.github.com>
Date: Thu, 22 Oct 2026 09:05:19 +0000
Subject: [PATCH 01/14] FreeChat: disappearing messages

- Room details: "Auto-delete messages" item with a TTL picker that sets
  the com.freechat.disappearing state event
- Timeline: hide deleted messages in rooms with a TTL (and server-expired
  ones anywhere) instead of showing placeholders
- Timeline notice when the setting changes
- JoinedRoom: stateEventContentFlow / sendStateEvent for raw custom state,
  with default implementations so fakes are untouched
- English, Simplified and Traditional Chinese strings in a separate
  freechat_strings.xml
